        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Pemko S105, Silicone Weatherstrip for Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Silicone Kerf-In Weatherstrip is typically used as a fire or smoke seal on commercial doors. It is impervious to fungus and mildew; will not deteriorate under normal exposure. Available in 30 foot and 100 foot lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Pemko Silicone Kerf-In Weatherstrip:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: high-grade silicone.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum space between the door face and the stop is 1/16\".</li>\r\n<li>The maximum space is 3/8\".</li>\r\n<li>Self-extinguishing and non-toxic.</li>\r\n<li>Stays flexible well below -100 degrees Fahrenheit and resilient above 400 degrees Fahrenheit.</li>\r\n<li>Unaffected by sunlight, ozone, and ultraviolet rays.</li>\r\n<li>Impervious to fungus and mildew; will not deteriorate under normal exposure.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial ordered item. <b>Not Returnable</b>.\r\n</p>",
